    <dc:description>A Specification Node is either a Learning Achievement Specification Shape, or a Learning Activity Specification Shape, or a Learning Assessment Specification Shape or a Learning Entitlement Specification  Shape. This shape is used for validation purposes, in case the range of a property is a Specification (superclass).</dc:description>
