    <sh:property>
      <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/snb/model/application-profile/loq-constraints/LearningAchievementSpecification-elm_ISCEDFCode">
        <sh:description xml:lang="el">Θεματικός τομέας σύμφωνα με την ταξινόμηση ISCED-F 2013.Εάν παρέχεται, η τιμή πρέπει να προέρχεται από το ελεγχόμενο λεξιλόγιο ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="sv">Temaområde enligt klassificeringen ISCED-F 2013. I förekommande fall ska värdet komma från ISCED-F:s kontrollerade terminologi (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="da">Tematisk område</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="no">Fagområde</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="nl">Thematisch gebied</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="pl">Obszar tematyczny według klasyfikacji ISCED-F z 2013 r. Jeżeli ją podano, wartość ta musi pochodzić ze słownika kontrolowanego klasyfikacji ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="sl">Tematsko področje</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="hu">Tematikus terület</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="el">Θεματικός τομέας</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="sl">Tematsko področje v skladu s klasifikacijo ISCED-F 2013. Če je vrednost navedena, mora izhajati iz kontroliranega besednjaka ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:minCount rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"
        >1</sh:minCount>
        <sh:description xml:lang="da">Tematisk område i henhold til ISCED-F 2013-klassifikationen. Hvis oplyst, skal værdien tages fra den kontrollerede ordliste for ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="it">Area tematica secondo la classificazione ISCED-F 2013. Se fornito, il valore deve essere tratto dal vocabolario controllato dell'ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="lt">Teminė sritis</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="tr">Tematik Alan</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="lv">Tematiskā joma</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="es">Ámbito temático con arreglo a la clasificación CINE-F 2013. Si se facilita, el valor debe proceder del vocabulario controlado de la CINE-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="fi">Aihealue</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="sv">Temaområde</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="nl">Thematisch gebied volgens de classificatie ISCED-F 2013. Indien verstrekt, moet de waarde afkomstig zijn uit de gecontroleerde woordenlijst voor ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="cs">Tematická oblast podle klasifikace ISCED-F 2013. Poskytnutá hodnota musí být převzata z řízeného slovníku ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="mt">Qasam Tematiku skont il-klassifikazzjoni ISCED-F 2013. Jekk jiġi pprovdut, il-valur irid jiġi mil-vokabularju kkontrollat tal-ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="fr">Domaine thématique conforme à la classification CITE-F 2013. Si elle est fournie, la valeur doit provenir du vocabulaire contrôlé CITE-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="en">Thematic Area according to the ISCED-F 2013 Classification .</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="no">Temaområde i henhold til ISCED-F 2013-klassifiseringen.Hvis oppgitt, må verdien komme fra det kontrollerte ISCED-F-vokabularet (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="tr">ISCED-F 2013 sınıflandırmasına göre Tematik Alan.Verilmişse, değerin Yeterlilik ISCED- F kontrol edilmiş sözlüğünden gelmesi zorunludur (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="hr">Tematsko područje prema klasifikaciji ISCED-F 2013. Ako je navedena, vrijednost mora biti iz kontroliranog rječnika ISCED-F-a (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="ro">Domeniul tematic</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="pt">Domínio temático de acordo com a classificação CITE-F 2013. Se for indicado, o valor deve provir do vocabulário controlado da CITE-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="ga">Réimse Téamach de réir aicmiú ISCED-F 2013. Má chuirtear ar fáil é, ní mór an luach teacht ó stór focal rialaithe ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/snb/model/application-profile/loq-constraints"/>
        <sh:path rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/snb/model/ontology/ISCEDFCode"/>
        <sh:name xml:lang="en">thematic area</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="ro">Domeniu tematic în conformitate cu clasificarea ISCED-F 2013. Dacă este furnizată, valoarea trebuie să provină din vocabularul controlat ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="et">Teemavaldkond vastavalt ISCED-F 2013 klassifikatsioonile. Kui väärtus on märgitud, peab see pärinema ISCED-Fi kontrollitud sõnastikust (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="mk">Thematic Area according to the ISCED-F 2013 classification. Ако е дадена, вредноста мора да биде од контролирани вокабулар на ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="de">Themenbereich gemäß der Klassifikation ISCED-F 2013. Falls angegeben, muss der Wert aus dem kontrollierten ISCED-F-Vokabular stammen (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="ga">An Réimse Téamach</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="fr">Domaine thématique</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="es">Ámbito temático</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="sr">Тематска област према ISCED-F 2013 класификацији. Ако се наводи, вредност мора да потиче из контролисаног вокабулара ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="pt">Área temática</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="mk">Тематска област</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="sr">0.0</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="en">Thematic Area according to the ISCED-F 2013 classification. If provided, the value must come from the ISCED-F controlled vocabulary (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="is">Þemasvið</sh:name>
        <sh:severity rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Violation"/>
        <sh:name xml:lang="hr">Tematsko područje</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="me">Tematsko područje</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="hu">Tematikus terület az ISCED-F 2013 osztályozás szerint. Az értéknek (ha meg van adva) az ISCED-F ellenőrzött szójegyzékéből kell származnia (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="bg">Тематична област</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="mt">Qasam Tematiku</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="cs">Tematická oblast</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="it">Area tematica</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="fi">ISCED-F 2013 -luokituksen mukainen aihe-alue. Jos arvo määritellään, sen on oltava kontrolloidusta sanastosta ISCED-F(http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="me">Tematsko područje prema klasifikaciji ISCED-F 2013. Ako je navedena, vrijednost mora da potiče iz ISCED-F kontrolisanog rječnika (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="sk">Tematická oblasť podľa klasifikácie ISCED-F 2013. Poskytnutá hodnota musí byť z riadeného slovníka ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="lt">Teminė sritis pagal ISCED-F 2013 m. klasifikaciją. Jei nurodoma, vertė turi būti iš ISCED-F kontrolinio žodyno (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:description xml:lang="bg">Тематична област в съответствие с класификацията ISCED-F 2013. Ако бъде посочена, стойността трябва да е от контролирания речник за ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:name xml:lang="et">Teemavaldkond</sh:name>
        <sh:name xml:lang="de">Themengebiet</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="is">Þemasvæði samkvæmt flokkun ISCED-F 2013.Ef til staðar, þarf gildið að koma úr stýrðum orðaforða ISCED-F (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:order rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"
        >4</sh:order>
        <sh:name xml:lang="pl">Obszar tematyczny</sh:name>
        <sh:description xml:lang="lv">Tematiskā joma saskaņā ar ISCED-F 2013 klasifikāciju. Var norādīt tikai vērtības, kas ņemtas no ISCED-F kontrolētas vārdnīcas (http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/international-education-classification).</sh:description>
        <sh:class rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <sh:name xml:lang="sk">Tematická oblasť</sh:name>
      </rdf:Description>
    </sh:property>
